<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA DISCOUNT RATE STEADY AT 18 PCT.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA DISCOUNT RATE STEADY AT 18 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's National Bank discount rate remained steady at 18 percent annual, since June 2, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>The rate, which fell to this level on June 2, was set at a credit funds auction on Monday, where eight banks acquired for a three-month term a total of 18.16 million lei of National Bank's reserves.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
